<title>CONGO: British tourist shot dead in Congo.</title>
<headline>British tourist shot dead in Congo.</headline>
<dateline>BRAZZAVILLE 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A British tourist has been shot dead in northwest Congo in an area with two game parks, diplomats said on Monday. They had no further details.</p>
<p>The incident happened in the Sangha region. Odzala and Nouable Ndoki parks are increasingly popular with tourists. Elephants, gorillas and a host of other animals live there.</p>
